        {
          "text": "30%",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nAccomplished magicians can create "
        },
        {
          "text": "improved Speed Patches",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " that can be sewn on top of the basic Speed Patch. \n\nStitching an improved patch onto a Pouch that already has a Speed Patch further increases the rate at which bound rituals ready themselves by an additional 30% each (to a "
        },
        {
          "text": "maximum of 90% increased ritual speed",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ")."
        }
      ]
    }
